  <div class="print-section">
    <h2>Complete Menu</h2>

    <h3>Koji-Marinated Roasted Turkey</h3>
    <p>Ingredients: Turkey, shio koji, maple syrup, clarified butter, turkey stock, aromatics (onion/celery/carrot), flour, herbs</p>

    <h3>Sides</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Brussels Sprouts:</strong> Brussels sprouts, sage sausage, fennel, onion, butter, maple syrup, sage</li>
      <li><strong>Hasselback Potatoes Au Gratin:</strong> Yukon gold potatoes, heavy cream, leeks, garlic, herbs, butter</li>
      <li><strong>Brioche Stuffing:</strong> Brioche, turkey stock, onion, celery, carrot, butter, herbs, eggs</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Bread & Condiments</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Milk Bread Rolls:</strong> Bread flour, milk, yeast, sugar, butter, salt, egg</li>
      <li><strong>Cranberry Orange Compote:</strong> Cranberries, oranges, sugar</li>
      <li><strong>Turkey Gravy:</strong> Stock, roux, potato starch, gelatin, xanthan gum</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Desserts</h3>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Pumpkin Pie:</strong> Pumpkin puree, sugar, eggs, evaporated milk, spices, pie crust</li>
      <li><strong>Eggnog Basque Cheesecake:</strong> Cream cheese, eggs, heavy cream, eggnog, sugar, nutmeg, vanilla</li>
    </ul>
